        "included": "Opaque-link bootstrap, phone OTP, imported-roster claim or Host approval, event-scoped profile intake, verified check-in, compatibility answers, First Hello, assignments, host-help requests, and private feedback in a mobile browser.",
        "excluded": [
          "The web runtime does not create a public Catch dating profile, expose private questionnaire answers to the Host, sell tickets, run waitlists, create mutual matches, or open member chats.",
